OL,3,GNEWSAEarl of Wessex among freshers in
OL,4,Auniversity procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong 250 university freshers including
OL,7,Fthe Earl of Wessex have marked the
OL,8,Fstart of their studies with a
OL,9,Fprocession through a town.
OL,11,FJames, the 18-year-old son of the Duke
OL,12,Fand Duchess of Edinburgh, has begun a
OL,13,Fdegree at the Royal Agricultural
OL,14,FUniversity in Cirencester.
OL,16,FHe joined students wearing gowns as
OL,17,Fthey walked in the procession through
OL,18,FCirencester's historic streets to a
OL,19,Fmatriculation ceremony at St John
OL,20,FBaptist Parish Church. The university
OL,21,Fis only one of four in the country
OL,22,Fobserving the tradition.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
