OL,3,GNEWSAEarl of Wessex among freshers in
OL,4,Auniversity procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Peter McCaffery, vice chancellor
OL,7,Fat the university, called it a "rite of
OL,8,Fpassage", adding: "On their way down
OL,9,Fthey are going to meet new friends and
OL,10,Fpossibly life-long relationships."
